-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Ffuture-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2>Investment in the autonomous vehicle industry can take three forms: direct investment, indirect investment, and autonomous vehicle startups</h2>\nsrc=\"/media/1485207_467-1024x683.jpg\"Investment in autonomous vehicle startups\n<h4><a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%85%d8%b9%d8%b1%d9%81%db%8c-%d9%81%d8%b1%d8%b5%d8%aa-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d8%af%d8%b1-%d8%aa%db%8c%d9%85-%d9%81%d9%86%d8%a7%d9%88/\" rel=\"noopener\">Investment</a> direct means investing in companies that produce autonomous vehicles, such as Tesla, Google, and other major automotive companies that operate in the field of autonomous vehicles. These companies, by striving to develop and improve autonomous vehicle technology, seek to attract investors. Investment in these companies can be through purchasing stocks, buying option tickets, direct investment in autonomous vehicle projects, or other investment methods.</h4>\n<h4>Indirect investment means investing in companies that produce the raw materials and equipment needed to build autonomous vehicles. For example, battery and software companies, radar and sensor equipment manufacturers, and companies that produce vehicle chassis and bodies. Investment in these companies can be done through direct investment or through the capital market.</h4>\n<h3>Since the autonomous vehicle industry is growing and developing, <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%be%d8%b1%d9%88%da%98%d9%87-%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%ad%db%8c-%d8%b4%d9%87%d8%b1-%d9%87%d9%88%d8%b4%d9%85%d9%86%d8%af/\" rel=\"noopener\">investment</a> in this industry may be attractive as an investment opportunity for investors. However, as we said earlier, trying to predict the performance and profitability of automotive companies may face challenges due to technical and economic limitations in the development and production of autonomous vehicles. For this reason, investors should invest in the autonomous vehicle industry by choosing companies with optimal approaches and strategies.</h3>\n<h3>Furthermore, considering the economic sanctions against some automotive companies and their negative impacts on the technological development and competitive capabilities of these companies, investors must carefully analyze which companies offer the best opportunities for investment in the autonomous vehicle industry.</h3>\n<h3>Also, it should be noted that the autonomous vehicle industry is one of the large and profitable industries in the world, but at the same time, it faces high competition. For example, companies like Tesla and Faraday are prominent in the autonomous vehicle industry and have very fierce competition with other major automotive companies like Ford and General Motors.</h3>\n<h3>In general, investment in the autonomous vehicle industry can be considered a profitable opportunity for investors, but to select the best companies for investment, careful analysis of the companies' performance and their approaches in developing autonomous vehicle technology must be conducted.</h3>\n\n<h3></h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>New autonomous vehicle startups have recently become an attractive area for <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%ac%d8%b0%d8%a8-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%db%8c%d8%b3%d8%aa%d9%85-%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%84%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%af%d9%88-%d8%aa%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\">investment</a>. Many investors have focused on this area and by providing facilities and investment, have helped new automotive startups to pursue growth and development. In this regard, the following statistics show how new automotive startups have progressed:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3>According to a CB Insights report in 2021, Tesla, the world's leading autonomous vehicle company, with a market value of $619 billion, is known as a startup that has managed to become one of the largest automotive companies in the world over the years.</h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>In 2021, Cruise Automation, which was founded in 2016 with the goal of developing autonomous vehicles, joined General Motors and the company's market value reached more than $30 billion.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Waymo, which is considered a pioneer in the field of autonomous vehicles, managed to reach a market value of over $30 billion in 2020.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Another company that has made significant progress in the autonomous vehicle field is Zoox. This company was acquired by Amazon for $1.3 billion in 2020.</h4>\n</li>\n</ul>\nsrc=\"/media/autonomous-car-3201.jpg\"Autonomous vehicles\n<h4>In general, new automotive startups are exciting areas that attract investors due to their capabilities in developing new technologies and using artificial intelligence and autonomous systems. Given the advantages that autonomous vehicles offer, it seems that many investors are looking to enter this field.</h4>\n\n\n\n<h4>To invest in new automotive startups, the following steps are usually followed:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>Identifying desirable startups: Investors usually look for new startups in the automotive industry that aim to develop new technologies. These companies usually seek to solve problems existing in the automotive industry, for example, reducing costs, increasing safety, increasing efficiency, etc.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Evaluating the management team: Investors usually look for experienced management teams with past successes when investing in a startup.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Reviewing the product: Investors usually look for innovative and attractive products when investing in a startup. These products must have superior advantages compared to existing products in the market.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Examining market conditions: Investors usually look at market conditions and market growth trends when investing in a startup. This can include market growth potential, competitive pricing, market risks, etc.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Investment and development: Finally, successful investors, based on the above reviews, if they decide to invest in an automotive startup, usually cooperate with the startup by providing initial capital for business development and achieving long-term goals.</h4>\nsrc=\"/media/future-of-self-driving-cars-5.jpg\"Investment in autonomous vehicle startups\n<h3></h3>\n<h3>With the expansion of the automotive industry, many large companies are creating new units or collaborating with startups. Also, supportive organizations are holding events like competitions and startup festivals to support automotive startups.</h3>\n<h3>Currently, many automotive startups are developing autonomous vehicles, but this field is still in its early stages, which means there is high potential for growth and development in the future.</h3>\n<h3>In general, investing in automotive startups, like any other industry, has its specific risks. However, given the steady growth of the automotive industry, increasing demand for autonomous vehicles, and support from organizations, this field has become one of the most attractive investment areas.</h3>\n<h2>And in the next part...</h2>\nsrc=\"/media/93fqclygib6b.jpeg\"Autonomous vehicles - Mehrdad startup<h3>If you're looking for an attractive investment opportunity in the automotive industry, we recommend this <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%af%d8%b9%d9%88%d8%aa-%d8%a8%d9%87-%d9%87%d9%85%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d9%be%d8%b1%d9%88%d8%ac%d9%87-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa-%d8%a2%d9%be%db%8c/\" rel=\"noopener\">startup</a> that, as one of the pioneers in the field of autonomous vehicles, can solve many challenges in this industry with a creative and innovative approach.</h3>\n<h3>In this startup, we are looking for investors who can accompany us in the development of autonomous vehicles. By using advanced technologies such as <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%ad-%d8%a7%d9%88%d9%84%db%8c%d9%87-pitch-deck-%d9%86%d8%b1%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%81%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%84%db%8c-%d8%a8%d8%a7%d9%86%da%a9%db%8c-%d9%86%d8%a6%d9%88-%d8%a8%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\">artificial intelligence and deep learning</a>, we aim to produce vehicles that can automatically reach their destination without the need for a driver.</h3>\n<h3>Our startup is composed of a team of professional engineers and researchers with extensive experience in various fields. Our goal is to help preserve the environment and reduce road accidents by offering autonomous vehicles.</h3>\n<h3>If you are interested in <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%ac%d8%b0%d8%a8-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%db%8c%d8%b3%d8%aa%d9%85-%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%84%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%af%d9%88-%d8%aa%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\">investing</a> in this <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%af%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%86-%d8%ac%d8%b0%d8%a8-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d9%82/\" rel=\"noopener\">startup</a>, you can contact us to review more details and get further information, and let's work towards building a successful partnership.</h3>\n<h5>Thank you, Mehrdad</h5>\n</li>\n</ol></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP Sprint I take your idea from first sketch to a live product — in weeks, not months.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:from-violet-700 hover:to-fuchsia-700\" href=\"/mvp-sprint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h